WEBVTT

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:07.710
<i>In some sense, they are like mirrors.</i>

00:00:09.410 --> 00:00:12.490
<i>Neither machines nor dolls...</i>

00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:18.750
<i>Reflecting the love that they receive from their
owners and growing up.</i>

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:20.970
<i>You are a...</i>

00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:25.490
<i>...Hybrid Child.</i>

00:00:52.340 --> 00:00:58.150
<i>Master is always by himself in the
flower garden.</i>

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:43.430
Yuzu? Why are you tiptoeing?

00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:46.430
Ichi-sama!

00:01:47.570 --> 00:01:52.360
Actually, I had planned to grow that tall
by this month,

00:01:52.360 --> 00:01:53.750
but for some reason, I didn't...

00:01:54.290 --> 00:01:57.490
Well, you can't grow in height just by
planning to...

00:01:55.160 --> 00:01:57.700
This month's target

00:02:00.510 --> 00:02:00.970
Come.

00:02:02.340 --> 00:02:04.800
I received some Castella cakes from the
Cultural Hall.

00:02:04.790 --> 00:02:06.010
Castella!

00:02:06.220 --> 00:02:07.350
Let's eat them together.

00:02:07.350 --> 00:02:07.800
Yes!

00:02:08.630 --> 00:02:11.610
Castella, Castella!

00:02:15.140 --> 00:02:15.770
Yuzu,

00:02:16.510 --> 00:02:20.620
everyone has their own pace of growing up,

00:02:20.830 --> 00:02:23.210
so you don't have to worry about it so much.

00:02:25.980 --> 00:02:26.600
Yes.

00:02:28.390 --> 00:02:29.850
<i>I'm not human.</i>

00:02:30.260 --> 00:02:31.940
<i>I'm called a Hybrid Child,</i>

00:02:32.310 --> 00:02:34.330
<i>a man-made doll</i>

00:02:34.980 --> 00:02:38.840
<i>which grows upon receiving it's master's love.</i>

00:02:39.730 --> 00:02:41.850
<i>My Master Ichi-sama,</i>

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:45.360
<i>used to work in some clan long ago,</i>

00:02:45.810 --> 00:02:48.480
<i>but it seems that he has retired now.</i>

00:02:49.160 --> 00:02:53.520
<i>He's very kind, smart and cool.</i>

00:02:53.720 --> 00:02:57.250
<i>Everyone in this mansion loves Ichi-sama a lot,</i>

00:02:58.300 --> 00:02:59.580
<i>but despite that...</i>

00:03:01.050 --> 00:03:02.530
Tiny

00:03:03.460 --> 00:03:04.350
<i>Why?</i>

00:03:04.880 --> 00:03:06.930
<i>Why won't I grow bigger?</i>

00:03:07.800 --> 00:03:10.410
<i>Even though Ichi-sama is extremely kind towards me...</i>

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:13.410
<i>Maybe I might be broken somewhere?</i>

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:16.040
<i>Or perhaps he actually...</i>

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:17.710
<i>...hates me!?</i>

00:03:21.040 --> 00:03:21.730
Yuzu?

00:03:22.990 --> 00:03:24.470
I'll give you half.

00:03:24.900 --> 00:03:25.800
What's wrong?

00:03:26.440 --> 00:03:27.710
Are you not feeling well?

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:28.640
No!

00:03:28.880 --> 00:03:30.450
In that case, eat it.

00:03:30.850 --> 00:03:32.190
Isn't this your favourite?

00:03:32.470 --> 00:03:33.270
No!

00:03:33.360 --> 00:03:35.130
Please eat it, Ichi-sama.

00:03:35.920 --> 00:03:38.440
<i>I don't care if anyone else comes to hate me,</i>

00:03:38.920 --> 00:03:41.150
<i>but I don't want Ichi-sama to hate me.</i>

00:03:41.800 --> 00:03:44.560
<i>Actually, I really really want to eat it,</i>

00:03:45.010 --> 00:03:47.290
<i>but if this would make Ichi-sama happy,</i>

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:49.440
<i>enduring this is nothing...</i>

00:03:50.050 --> 00:03:51.650
<i>Probably...</i>

00:03:54.170 --> 00:03:55.070
What's wrong?

00:03:55.590 --> 00:03:58.320
If you have something to say, just tell me.

00:03:58.650 --> 00:03:59.890
B-But...

00:04:01.250 --> 00:04:02.380
I won't get angry.

00:04:03.870 --> 00:04:05.890
T-That is...

00:04:06.690 --> 00:04:08.680
Sorry for repeating this so many times...

00:04:09.110 --> 00:04:13.160
I wonder why... I'm not growing up.

00:04:13.730 --> 00:04:16.390
Could it be that I'm broken somewhere?

00:04:16.840 --> 00:04:17.770
Or is it that...

00:04:18.270 --> 00:04:21.120
Ichi-sama perhaps hates me...

00:04:22.110 --> 00:04:24.610
That's what... I was...worrying about...

00:04:26.280 --> 00:04:28.670
Does Yuzu hate me?

00:04:30.880 --> 00:04:32.190
Then it's alright.

00:04:32.780 --> 00:04:36.010
That's called worrying needlessly,

00:04:37.290 --> 00:04:39.700
because I love Yuzu.

00:04:41.290 --> 00:04:43.640
So then, eat your own share.

00:04:44.080 --> 00:04:45.030
No way!

00:04:45.480 --> 00:04:48.110
If I can't keep up the word I gave,

00:04:48.110 --> 00:04:49.670
I can't call myself a man!

00:04:50.480 --> 00:04:52.140
Stubborn

00:04:52.820 --> 00:04:54.290
Then, that's right...

00:04:54.840 --> 00:04:56.330
Let's have half of it each.

00:05:02.800 --> 00:05:05.060
<i>Love... half of it...</i>

00:05:07.970 --> 00:05:10.100
<i>Ichi-sama's words are kind.</i>

00:05:17.610 --> 00:05:21.220
<i>I'll bring this month's target over to
the next month...</i>

00:05:21.990 --> 00:05:23.790
<i>Because something good happened today,</i>

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:26.000
<i>I might suddenly shoot up tomorrow.</i>

00:05:29.540 --> 00:05:31.590
<i>But to be on par with Ichi-sama,</i>

00:05:31.790 --> 00:05:33.650
<i>is still something far far away.</i>

00:05:47.560 --> 00:05:48.360
<i>Again.</i>

00:05:49.380 --> 00:05:50.770
<i>There's light in the garden.</i>

00:05:55.280 --> 00:05:56.680
<i>The one over there...</i>

00:06:04.100 --> 00:06:05.400
<i>...isn't a ghost.</i>

00:06:12.540 --> 00:06:13.500
<i>Ichi-sama...</i>

00:06:55.440 --> 00:06:57.950
<i>Once, I thought of calling out to him</i>

00:06:58.220 --> 00:07:01.340
<i>but I was severely reproached by the helper
who saw me.</i>

00:07:08.600 --> 00:07:11.180
<i>Everyone looked like they knew the reason, but...</i>

00:07:11.950 --> 00:07:14.290
<i>nobody would tell me.</i>

00:07:22.970 --> 00:07:23.840
<i>That said,</i>

00:07:24.760 --> 00:07:28.270
<i>it didn't seem like I could ask Ichi-sama
about it directly either.</i>

00:07:30.260 --> 00:07:31.710
<i>The only thing that frightened me...</i>

00:07:32.780 --> 00:07:36.940
<i>...were the crimson flowers which floated
in the darkness,</i>

00:07:40.030 --> 00:07:43.750
<i>and the never before seen expression
on Ichi-sama's face.</i>

00:08:00.650 --> 00:08:02.410
<i>I want to grow up fast.</i>

00:08:03.410 --> 00:08:06.020
<i>If I grow up and become more mature,</i>

00:08:07.090 --> 00:08:10.280
<i>I think I'll be able to become Ichi-sama's emotional
support too.</i>

00:08:11.850 --> 00:08:14.900
<i>Why do you have such a painful expression
on your face?</i>

00:08:15.800 --> 00:08:18.230
<i>Is there anything that I can do for you?</i>

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:23.660
<i>I wonder what is reflected in Ichi-sama's eyes?</i>

00:08:49.060 --> 00:08:49.940
Ichi-sama!

00:08:50.950 --> 00:08:52.420
Have intercourse with me!

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:56.480
Int-...What?

00:08:56.740 --> 00:08:58.560
When I went to buy flowers earlier,

00:08:58.880 --> 00:09:02.840
the florist was a Hybrid Child just like me.

00:09:03.190 --> 00:09:06.140
But that lady was really beautiful,

00:09:06.650 --> 00:09:09.060
since she looked so mature, I asked her *that method

00:09:06.650 --> 00:09:09.060
*that- he means the method to grow up

00:09:09.620 --> 00:09:11.870
and she explained it to me thoroughly...

00:09:12.260 --> 00:09:13.440
Let's see,

00:09:13.890 --> 00:09:16.590
why don't you just share some love with you master?

00:09:18.020 --> 00:09:19.600
According to her,

00:09:19.900 --> 00:09:23.750
Ichi-sama should thrust himself in my butthole...

00:09:23.980 --> 00:09:26.510
until I become all messy and wet

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:30.620
and we should indulge in the world of sensual
pleasure every day...

00:09:31.600 --> 00:09:33.150
Yuzu, stop it!

00:09:34.050 --> 00:09:37.990
Why are you in such a hurry to grow up?

00:09:39.030 --> 00:09:42.390
Don't you realize that girl was just teasing you?

00:09:42.380 --> 00:09:44.390
Really? I'll stop talking...

00:09:44.870 --> 00:09:48.540
<i>I can't say that it's because I want to be
able to listen to Ichi-sama's worries.</i>

00:09:48.960 --> 00:09:52.190
Did that lady really lie to me?

00:09:53.090 --> 00:09:55.480
No, it's not a lie...

00:09:55.880 --> 00:09:57.430
Then, let's give it a try!

00:09:57.650 --> 00:10:01.170
If it's Ichi-sama, I'll be fine no matter how much
it hurts.

00:10:01.560 --> 00:10:02.410
Come at me!

00:10:02.910 --> 00:10:04.360
Come at you...?

00:10:08.890 --> 00:10:09.840
Also,

00:10:11.830 --> 00:10:14.460
if Ichi-sama doesn't teach me,

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:16.700
I'll never come to understand it.

00:10:17.400 --> 00:10:19.260
I think that not knowing anything

00:10:20.060 --> 00:10:20.730
is very

00:10:21.910 --> 00:10:23.460
unfortunate.

00:10:28.170 --> 00:10:28.870
Then,

00:10:29.720 --> 00:10:30.660
close your eyes.

00:10:55.020 --> 00:10:55.860
Ichi-sama?

00:10:57.300 --> 00:10:58.410
How does it feel?

00:10:59.390 --> 00:11:01.310
How it feels...

00:11:02.060 --> 00:11:04.070
...it feels sort of itchy.

00:11:05.220 --> 00:11:06.070
Is that all?

00:11:06.950 --> 00:11:07.510
Huh?

00:11:08.630 --> 00:11:09.240
Yes.

00:11:11.570 --> 00:11:13.760
Well... I guess it's fine.

00:11:14.770 --> 00:11:18.120
What is it, did I say something wrong?

00:11:18.790 --> 00:11:21.250
I just said what I honestly felt...

00:11:22.430 --> 00:11:23.060
Huh?

00:11:23.570 --> 00:11:25.990
But my heart feels like it's been squeezed.

00:11:26.600 --> 00:11:28.240
Rather than being squeezed,

00:11:28.800 --> 00:11:31.130
it feels like it's pumping really fast...

00:11:34.830 --> 00:11:35.430
Yuzu?

00:11:38.060 --> 00:11:40.530
S-so-sorry! sorry!

00:11:40.590 --> 00:11:42.460
I'll go wash my face!

00:11:45.920 --> 00:11:48.210
He learnt how to be embarrassed.

00:11:49.330 --> 00:11:50.550
<i>My heart's pumping really fast,</i>

00:11:50.900 --> 00:11:53.380
<i>the places where I was touched are tingling.</i>

00:11:53.850 --> 00:11:54.870
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:11:55.310 --> 00:11:56.870
<i>I think this is weird.</i>

00:11:57.820 --> 00:11:59.510
<i>My head is all muddled up,</i>

00:12:00.110 --> 00:12:01.730
<i>my body is tingling,</i>

00:12:02.330 --> 00:12:04.280
<i>my heart won't stop pounding.</i>

00:12:04.990 --> 00:12:06.800
<i>What is this feeling?</i>

00:12:07.900 --> 00:12:10.000
<i>The only thing I'm very clear of,</i>

00:12:10.650 --> 00:12:13.720
<i>is that I really love Ichi-sama.</i>

00:12:17.670 --> 00:12:18.380
Master,

00:12:19.870 --> 00:12:21.330
another one of those letters...

00:12:29.150 --> 00:12:31.380
"Seya Ichi, I will kill you this month"

00:12:32.130 --> 00:12:33.390
What should we do?

00:12:34.260 --> 00:12:37.540
At first I thought that we could just
throw them away,

00:12:37.900 --> 00:12:39.200
but now that it's escalated to this...

00:12:39.600 --> 00:12:42.270
Should we report this to the police?

00:12:42.950 --> 00:12:43.850
It's alright.

00:12:43.960 --> 00:12:47.870
But, if something were to happen to Master...

00:12:48.240 --> 00:12:48.940
No.

00:12:51.140 --> 00:12:55.440
I will have to atone for my sins.

00:12:56.620 --> 00:12:57.360
Master...

00:12:58.460 --> 00:12:59.360
Even so,

00:12:59.690 --> 00:13:04.420
there's no way I can be saved.

00:13:08.440 --> 00:13:09.590
<i>Crimson flower...</i>

00:13:17.230 --> 00:13:18.140
<i>That night,</i>

00:13:18.890 --> 00:13:20.160
<i>Ichi-sama was again</i>

00:13:20.900 --> 00:13:22.530
<i>in the flower garden alone,</i>

00:13:23.380 --> 00:13:25.810
<i>wearing that pained expression.</i>

00:13:26.920 --> 00:13:29.490
<i>Nobody was able to extend a hand towards him.</i>

00:13:30.350 --> 00:13:33.050
<i>Or rather, it felt like he was rejecting everyone.</i>

00:13:34.070 --> 00:13:35.790
<i>I, like all other times...</i>

00:13:36.670 --> 00:13:40.300
<i>...could only look at him from afar.</i>

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:50.110
Yuzu.

00:13:55.380 --> 00:13:56.590
Ichi-sama.

00:13:57.760 --> 00:13:58.570
You...

00:13:59.080 --> 00:14:00.580
...grew bigger.

00:14:01.070 --> 00:14:05.120
I knew it! I grew a little bigger, right?

00:14:05.370 --> 00:14:07.660
It's just like what that lady said!

00:14:08.120 --> 00:14:09.740
Let's continue with what we were doing!

00:14:09.920 --> 00:14:13.700
With Ichi-sama, make me all messy and
wet, after that...

00:14:13.400 --> 00:14:14.610
Stop it!

00:14:15.460 --> 00:14:17.040
But this is troubling.

00:14:17.550 --> 00:14:20.930
At this rate, you won't fit into your western clothes.

00:14:21.310 --> 00:14:24.170
Shall we visit the tailor's and get you some new clothes?

00:14:24.440 --> 00:14:27.920
Ah, then shall we walk to the shop?

00:14:28.180 --> 00:14:29.820
It's warm outside too.

00:14:29.810 --> 00:14:33.970
<i>If we do that, perhaps Ichi-sama's mood
will brighten.</i>

00:14:38.920 --> 00:14:40.660
Master, the car.

00:14:41.220 --> 00:14:41.920
No.

00:14:44.940 --> 00:14:47.600
I'll go on foot with Yuzu.

00:14:48.960 --> 00:14:50.310
Yuzu, come.

00:14:55.600 --> 00:14:56.620
<i>That's right,</i>

00:14:57.440 --> 00:15:00.160
<i>I can just start from doing what I'm capable of.</i>

00:15:14.120 --> 00:15:15.510
It suits you really well.

00:15:16.440 --> 00:15:17.960
It's the same as Ichi-sama's.

00:15:19.110 --> 00:15:20.620
Then, shall we go?

00:15:21.230 --> 00:15:22.620
Yes, Ichi-sama!

00:15:40.530 --> 00:15:42.890
If you see anything you want, just tell me.

00:15:43.250 --> 00:15:44.220
It's alright.

00:15:45.890 --> 00:15:46.660
Ichi-sama!

00:15:56.290 --> 00:15:57.240
Do you want that?

00:15:58.410 --> 00:16:02.170
No, I just thought that it's very pretty
because it's so shiny.

00:16:27.720 --> 00:16:30.390
Yuzu, if you want it, I'll buy it for you.

00:16:31.350 --> 00:16:32.430
It's alright.

00:16:35.310 --> 00:16:36.120
What's wrong?

00:16:36.460 --> 00:16:38.080
You're in a strangely good mood.

00:16:38.230 --> 00:16:39.260
Is that so?

00:16:49.120 --> 00:16:52.150
<i>Ichi-sama seems to have cheered up.</i>

00:16:53.520 --> 00:16:55.440
<i>I knew it was the right choice to ask him out.</i>

00:17:14.220 --> 00:17:14.970
That's right,

00:17:15.900 --> 00:17:18.630
shall we buy some Castella on our way home?

00:17:19.120 --> 00:17:20.530
Really?

00:17:21.020 --> 00:17:23.190
Since today is special, we'll buy two slices.

00:17:30.930 --> 00:17:32.950
Seya, prepare yourself!

00:17:38.240 --> 00:17:39.250
Ichi-sama!

00:17:54.080 --> 00:17:57.270
I'll take revenge for my family!

00:17:57.540 --> 00:17:59.640
Ichi-sama, run away!

00:18:03.690 --> 00:18:04.460
Ichi...

00:18:05.700 --> 00:18:07.830
<i>Why won't he run away?</i>

00:18:14.860 --> 00:18:16.080
<i>Crimson flower,</i>

00:18:16.660 --> 00:18:17.930
<i>crimson flower.</i>

00:18:19.070 --> 00:18:21.450
Even though he's in no danger of losing
his life...

00:18:22.580 --> 00:18:24.890
<i>Crimson is the color of blood.</i>

00:18:25.100 --> 00:18:28.490
It will be extremely difficult for him
to regain his eyesight.

00:18:29.890 --> 00:18:35.170
A long time ago, Master took on an important
role within a certain clan.

00:18:35.890 --> 00:18:39.670
That clan has been dispersed during the Restoration.

00:18:40.490 --> 00:18:42.970
Back then, a great war occurred.

00:18:44.080 --> 00:18:48.110
The battle which Master led was one of
the terrible ones.

00:18:48.380 --> 00:18:52.410
Many soldiers and even citizens were involved.

00:18:53.260 --> 00:18:55.870
We couldn't even estimate exactly how many died.

00:18:57.170 --> 00:19:00.770
Even now, Master is still pained by it.

00:19:01.640 --> 00:19:05.050
Although it was his duty to lead the battle,

00:19:05.380 --> 00:19:08.440
he couldn't help but blame himself for it.

00:19:09.370 --> 00:19:12.580
Even in times of peace, Master searches for those
whose families suffered during the war,

00:19:12.570 --> 00:19:15.380
regardless of whose side they were on, and offer
them support.

00:19:15.870 --> 00:19:20.830
But, as expected, there is a group of people who
are like that man from just now.

00:19:23.070 --> 00:19:27.950
<i>Ichi-sama didn't tell anyone about his pain,</i>

00:19:28.540 --> 00:19:31.100
<i>he's only set on putting the blame on himself.</i>

00:19:32.580 --> 00:19:35.220
Don't talk about me as though I'm a good person.

00:19:35.910 --> 00:19:40.190
I'm just a coward who couldn't commit suicide.

00:19:43.910 --> 00:19:45.860
Ichi-sama! Master.

00:19:46.760 --> 00:19:50.020
Sorry, could you leave this room for the moment?

00:19:50.440 --> 00:19:51.710
I need to speak with Yuzu.

00:19:52.200 --> 00:19:52.630
Yes.

00:19:56.140 --> 00:19:59.820
Sorry, sorry, I'm sorry.

00:19:59.920 --> 00:20:03.070
If I hadn't asked for us to walk there,

00:20:05.000 --> 00:20:07.330
Ichi-sama wouldn't have ended up like this.

00:20:07.570 --> 00:20:11.580
Sorry, sorry, I'm sorry...

00:20:13.410 --> 00:20:14.530
Don't cry.

00:20:15.320 --> 00:20:16.920
It's not your fault.

00:20:17.460 --> 00:20:20.290
That man has the right to kill me.

00:20:20.750 --> 00:20:23.040
Please don't say such thing.

00:20:23.060 --> 00:20:26.720
Ichi-sama is not at fault, definitely not!

00:20:29.460 --> 00:20:30.080
Yuzu,

00:20:32.230 --> 00:20:34.600
when you've calmed down, gather your things.

00:20:35.240 --> 00:20:39.850
It's better for you to be brought up by a
better owner.

00:20:42.130 --> 00:20:44.300
Let's have you go back to Kuroda's place.

00:20:45.860 --> 00:20:49.890
Kuroda is the man who created the Hybrid Child.

00:20:50.410 --> 00:20:52.320
He's also my old friend.

00:20:52.830 --> 00:20:54.360
If I leave you in this hands,

00:20:54.490 --> 00:20:56.960
I'm sure he'll send you to a proper household.

00:20:56.950 --> 00:20:59.000
No! I don't want that!

00:20:59.240 --> 00:21:02.690
Why? Have you come to hate me?

00:21:02.950 --> 00:21:04.100
It's not that.

00:21:04.260 --> 00:21:07.350
I don't want that! I want to stay here!

00:21:07.590 --> 00:21:10.040
I've gotten a lot of thing from you.

00:21:11.970 --> 00:21:12.740
However,

00:21:13.550 --> 00:21:17.060
there might be nothing I can give to you.

00:21:17.760 --> 00:21:18.480
I'm sorry.

00:21:19.950 --> 00:21:22.980
I wanted to show only the beautiful
things to Yuzu.

00:21:28.830 --> 00:21:29.620
I get it,

00:21:30.210 --> 00:21:31.620
the reason why I...

00:21:33.080 --> 00:21:34.870
...couldn't grow up.

00:21:38.700 --> 00:21:43.330
Ichi-sama has only been showering me with kindness.

00:21:44.050 --> 00:21:45.360
That won't do!

00:21:45.430 --> 00:21:52.540
You should let me experience more of the painful,
sad, exasperating and unpleasant things!

00:21:52.750 --> 00:21:56.540
If not, I won't be able to grow up!

00:21:57.250 --> 00:22:00.920
Even now, I don't understand why I'm
getting so upset.

00:22:01.170 --> 00:22:03.160
Please teach me so that can understand this.

00:22:03.840 --> 00:22:07.710
I want to stay with Ichi-sama and be of use to you.

00:22:09.220 --> 00:22:13.940
I want to listen to all your worries and be
able to cheer you up.

00:22:14.270 --> 00:22:18.080
That's why, please let me grow up quickly.

00:22:19.220 --> 00:22:23.760
If I've grown up and you still don't need me,
please throw me away then.

00:22:24.930 --> 00:22:25.450
But,

00:22:28.150 --> 00:22:34.520
I really don't want to leave you!

00:22:41.650 --> 00:22:42.480
Yuzu...

00:22:44.010 --> 00:22:45.600
Why do you...

00:22:48.240 --> 00:22:51.950
<i>Hybrid Child is a reflection of its owner.</i>

00:22:52.870 --> 00:22:56.020
<i>Neither a machine nor a doll,</i>

00:22:56.550 --> 00:23:01.020
<i>Is there crimson blood flowing in that body?</i>

00:23:02.520 --> 00:23:03.480
Thank you.

00:23:21.970 --> 00:23:26.870
Tsumetai sono taion wo kanjiteru

00:23:21.970 --> 00:23:26.870
Feeling the coolness of your body temperature

00:23:26.860 --> 00:23:31.480
Kasanaru kage ni mo himitsu madotte

00:23:26.860 --> 00:23:31.480
Even the overlapping shadows hide secrets

00:23:40.690 --> 00:23:44.660
Yurari, Yurari

00:23:40.690 --> 00:23:44.660
Swaying, swaying,

00:23:45.430 --> 00:23:49.320
Kokoro ga yureteru

00:23:45.430 --> 00:23:49.320
My heart is swaying

00:23:49.940 --> 00:23:59.100
Zutto onaji basho wo motomete

00:23:49.940 --> 00:23:59.100
Always seeking for the same place

00:23:59.770 --> 00:24:03.940
Kagami no youni utsushidashite

00:23:59.770 --> 00:24:03.940
Reflecting like a mirror

00:24:03.930 --> 00:24:08.610
Tashikametai setsuna no kioku

00:24:03.930 --> 00:24:08.610
The sad memories I want to confirm

00:24:08.600 --> 00:24:17.550
Sono karada katachi sae futari no mono dakara

00:24:08.600 --> 00:24:17.550
because the silhouette of that body belongs to the two of us

00:24:18.890 --> 00:24:23.730
Tsumetai sono taion wo kanjite

00:24:18.890 --> 00:24:23.730
Feeling the coolness of your body temperature

00:24:23.720 --> 00:24:28.330
Chiisai hana he te omoitakushite

00:24:23.720 --> 00:24:28.330
Entrusting our feelings to little flowers

00:24:28.320 --> 00:24:31.430
Tsuki no hikari no shita

00:24:28.320 --> 00:24:31.430
Beneath the moonlight

00:24:31.510 --> 00:24:37.300
Doko made mo yukimashou issho ni

00:24:31.510 --> 00:24:37.300
I'll go anywhere with you, together

00:24:39.760 --> 00:24:42.120
Tsunaida te ni,

00:24:39.760 --> 00:24:42.120
Our intertwined fingers

00:24:44.570 --> 00:24:48.190
Nagarekomu koro

00:24:44.570 --> 00:24:48.190
the time which flows by

00:24:52.380 --> 00:24:53.570
And then,

00:24:54.050 --> 00:24:58.750
it's bothering us that the color of the cherry
blossoms gets paler every year.

00:24:58.890 --> 00:24:59.560
Is that so?

00:24:59.780 --> 00:25:00.340
Yes.

00:25:00.820 --> 00:25:03.060
It might be due to the climate change.

00:25:03.430 --> 00:25:05.220
The number of factories has increased too.

00:25:06.350 --> 00:25:08.390
But the smell is still the same.

00:25:08.560 --> 00:25:10.690
Do cherry blossoms have fragrance?

00:25:11.050 --> 00:25:14.090
It isn't as strong as the plums, but there is.

00:25:15.040 --> 00:25:17.850
Master, it's time for tea.

00:25:18.380 --> 00:25:20.060
We're having Castella today.

00:25:20.420 --> 00:25:21.590
Castella!

00:25:21.980 --> 00:25:23.440
You haven't changed a bit.

00:25:23.480 --> 00:25:26.420
You're just like a child when it comes to Castella.

00:25:28.490 --> 00:25:29.830
What did you say?

00:25:30.100 --> 00:25:31.210
Fine.

00:25:31.390 --> 00:25:33.210
I'll give you my share.

00:25:33.670 --> 00:25:34.670
It's alright.

00:25:35.000 --> 00:25:37.430
They say that grudges over food are the scariest.

00:25:37.420 --> 00:25:40.700
I said its fine, I'll give it to Ichi-sama.

00:25:41.330 --> 00:25:41.870
Is that so?

00:25:42.760 --> 00:25:45.040
Then, shall we have half each?

00:25:46.260 --> 00:25:51.460
<i>Master was always alone in the garden.</i>

00:25:52.010 --> 00:25:52.660
Yes.

00:25:53.350 --> 00:25:54.080
<i>But...</i>

00:25:55.100 --> 00:25:58.290
<i>from now on, I'll be with him. Together.</i>

